      "type": "question",
      "label": null,
      "prompt": "Write $|5-3x|$ as a piecewise-defined function.",
      "answer": {
       "short": "$\\displaystyle |5-3x|=\\begin{cases}5-3x,&x\\le\\frac53,\\\\3x-5,&x>\\frac53.\\end{cases}$",
       "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}|5-3x|&=\\begin{cases}5-3x,&5-3x\\ge0,\\\\-(5-3x),&5-3x<0\\end{cases}\\\\|5-3x|&=\\begin{cases}5-3x,&x\\le\\frac53,\\\\3x-5,&x>\\frac53.\\end{cases}\\end{align*}$$\nDividing an inequality by $-3$ reverses its direction."
      },
      "questionDiagrams": []
     },
